      "text": "Free is the whole game. Same twelve months, same pitch, same scoring, same board. Pro opens more of the world — never a better game. FREE $0 Four industries, whole game One company a day — no redo The full pitch, scored the same The wardrobe track banks progress PLAY FREE PRO $6.99 / month OR $39.99 A YEAR — $43.89 LESS All twelve industries Three companies a day The Room — cold-call real investors Wear the wardrobe you earn MONTHLY YEARLY Billed by Stripe. Both plans renew automatically — $6.99 each month or $39.99 each year — until you cancel, which you can do at any time from Settings. Term",
