      "heading": "Questions people ask.",
      "backgroundColor": "#EDEBE6",
      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "Questions people ask. What is Novus? Novus is a business simulation game. You run a company month by month — hiring, pricing, product, the lot — and at the end of each fiscal year the game stops and asks you to pitch it out loud, on camera, to five investors who have read your numbers. Is Novus free? Yes. The whole game is free: twelve months, the full pitch, the same scoring and the same leaderboard. Novus Pro opens more of the world — extra industries, more runs a day — and never buys a score, a survival or a place on the board. Do I need a camera to play? You need one to close a fiscal year",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
